This is a demonstration of a proposed template for vertical timelines. It needs no JavaScript: it is wikitext plus TemplateStyles, and it follows the reader's light or dark theme. Source and a live prototype: https://github.com/psygo/wikipedia_timeline (prototype at https://psygo.github.io/wikipedia_timeline/). The sample content is only there to show the layout; check any dates before reusing them.

== Simple timeline ==
{{User:Fanaro009/Timeline sandbox
|{{User:Fanaro009/Timeline sandbox/item |date=1612 |title=The Go academy |text=The Tokugawa shogunate patronises the game and forms the houses of professional players.}}
{{User:Fanaro009/Timeline sandbox/item |date=1846 |title=The Ear-Reddening Game |text=Shusaku's move 127 stuns Gennan Inseki.}}
{{User:Fanaro009/Timeline sandbox/item |date=March 2016 |title=AlphaGo defeats Lee Sedol |text=AlphaGo wins four games to one in Seoul.}}
}}

